    'bericht.html.anleitungTitel' = 'How to read this report'
    'bericht.html.guideEinleitung' = 'pc-check checks the security and performance of your PC and rates every item with a status. The check does not change anything on the system.'
    'bericht.html.guideVorgehen' = 'How to proceed'
    'bericht.html.guide1Html' = 'At the top, the <b>traffic light</b> shows the overall state, below it you find <b>the next steps</b>, meaning the most important items first, and the <b>most worthwhile tips</b>.'
    'bericht.html.guide2Html' = 'Every tip carries three labels: <b>Benefit</b> (what it brings), <b>Effort</b> (how long it takes) and <b>Risk</b> (what could go wrong). Under <b>“How to”</b> you find the way through the settings, often with a command you can copy.'
    'bericht.html.guide3Html' = 'With <b>“✔ done”</b> and <b>“⏱ later”</b> you build your own <b>checklist</b>. If you open the next report in the same browser, it shows what has really been fixed.'
    'bericht.html.guide4Html' = 'The recommendations depend on the <b>profile</b> (here: {0}). If it does not fit, start the script with <code>-Profil Gaming</code>, <code>Office</code> or <code>Laptop</code>.'
    'bericht.html.guide5Html' = 'Click the <b>i icon</b> next to a check: the speech bubble explains what is checked, why it matters and <b>when a warning is harmless</b>.'
    'bericht.html.guide6Html' = 'If a warning is intentional on your PC (for example a remote maintenance tool that you use), add it to <code>accepted.psd1</code> (template: <code>accepted.example.psd1</code>). From then on it appears as “Accepted”.'
    'bericht.html.guide7Html' = 'With <b>filter</b> and <b>search</b> at the top you hide everything you are not interested in right now. Clicking a number at the traffic light filters by that status.'
    'bericht.html.guide8Html' = 'Not sure? <b>“Copy for AI assistant”</b> puts the findings on the clipboard without PC names, user names and addresses, ready to paste into ChatGPT or Claude. Read the text briefly before you paste it.'
    'bericht.html.guide9Html' = 'Before you change the BIOS, drivers, BitLocker or security features, ask someone who knows their way around if you are in doubt.'
    'bericht.html.guideSchluss' = 'The report contains many details about your PC. Do not pass it on carelessly.'
    'bericht.html.fuss' = '{0} – {1} {2} · created {3} · Markdown and JSON versions are in the same folder.'

